  "descriptions": [
    "Located right on Mobile Bay on historic Fort Morgan Road, Pelican Roost is the perfect spot for large families or groups of up to 15 guests to gather together for quality time on the bay. With a pier for fishing and easy access to the water, spectacular bay views, an expansive deck, an updated fully-stocked kitchen, spacious living spaces – and frequent visits from our pelican friends – Pelican Roost is the place to be.",
    "Living Spaces\nWith a completely open floor plan, it’s easy for everyone to gather together at Pelican Roost. The living area is light, bright, and spacious, with huge windows overlooking the bay, plush seating, and a flatscreen TV with an extensive DVD collection to keep you entertained on rainy days. There is also a built-in desk if you need to get some work done while you’re away.",
    "Kitchen & Dining\nThe chef won’t ever have to miss out on the party – the beautiful, updated kitchen is completely open to the living room. It shares those same beautiful bay views and has a massive kitchen island with bar seating, a wine fridge, a dishwasher, and everything else needed for prepping meals. And with glass-front upper cabinets, it’s easy to find what you need. When it’s time to dine, there’s a large dining table with stunning bay views and seating for twelve."
  ],
